WEBVTT

00:05:27.448 --> 00:05:31.202
from Fresno, California
to Wilkesboro, North Carolina.

00:05:32.036 --> 00:05:36.624
I didn't realize it, but I'd accidentally
started a virtual nonprofit.

00:05:36.665 --> 00:05:39.502
We didn’t just use the internet
to deliver our services,

00:05:39.543 --> 00:05:43.005
our organization existed on the internet.

00:05:43.047 --> 00:05:45.800
Because our program
was run entirely by volunteers

00:05:45.841 --> 00:05:47.635
from around the country

00:05:47.676 --> 00:05:50.429
who work together for a common cause,

00:05:50.471 --> 00:05:52.640
despite never meeting once in person.

00:05:53.182 --> 00:05:56.435
Because our students and teachers
could learn from each other online,

00:05:56.435 --> 00:05:57.853
wherever they were,

00:05:57.853 --> 00:06:00.856
geographic boundaries no longer mattered.